<UML:Comment id="3f7e284a-ae88-11f1-ac14-a0b339ffe565">
<body>
<val>Un PlanAssignment ha 4 AssignmentWeek per ogni MonthlyBlock della sua TrainingPlan, numerate da 1 a 4 per ogni MonthlyBlock</val>
</body>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="de4369c2-b0ef-11f1-a4f9-a0b339ffe565"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
</UML:Comment>
<UML:Comment id="86c0c7d0-ae88-11f1-ac14-a0b339ffe565">
<body>
<val>startDate = planAssignment.startDate + (weekNumber - 1)
endDate = planAssignment.startDate + (weekNumber * 7) - 1</val>
</body>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="de334ec0-b0ef-11f1-a4f9-a0b339ffe565"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
</UML:Comment>
